sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant A as Alice
    participant B as Bob

    note over A,B: interactive data sync

    A->>A: add offers to payload state
    A-->>B: send payload with offers

    B->>B: add requests to payload state
    B-->>A: send payload with requests

    A->>A: add requested messages to state
    A-->>B: send payload with messages

    B->>B: add acks to payload state
    B-->>A: send payload with acks

